+|-------|-----------|
+| Framework m├│vil | **Capacitor 8.4.2** (`@capacitor/core`, `@capacitor/ios`, `@capacitor/android`) |
+| No es | Expo / React Native / Cordova puro |
+| Web | Next.js **14.2** + React **18.3** |
+| Carga web | `capacitor.config.ts` ÔåÆ `server.url: "https://www.celimap.com.ar"` |
+| Fallback offline | `www/index.html` (mensaje ÔÇ£necesit├ís conexi├│nÔÇØ) |
+| Pantallas nativas | Splash + WebView. Cero pantallas UI nativas |
