+| User-Agent | `appendUserAgent: " CelimapNative/1"` |
+| Plugins | App, Browser, SplashScreen, StatusBar |
+| Auth nativa | Browser externo + deep link `celimap://auth/handoff` |
+| App ID | `com.celimap.app` |
+
+### Versiones relevantes
