+# Lote 2 ÔÇö Safe areas & layout m├│vil
+
+## Fase 0 ÔÇö Separaci├│n
+
+- `stash@{0}: KEEP-backup-wip-pre-lote1` **intacto**
+- Patches: `docs/baselines/lote-separation/`
+  - `lote1-tracked.diff`
+  - `p2-wip-tracked.diff`
